Meta:
	Version	1
	
	Lang	ja
	Title	終わりの時
	Desc	ゲージ上昇UP <#c:00f>(240%)
	Desc	JUSTICE判定以下20回で強制終了
	
	Lang	en
	Title	The End of Time
	Desc	Increments the gauge increase rate to
	Desc	<#c:00f>240%<#r>.
	Desc	<#c:70f>Sidden Death occurs<#r> when JUSTICE or
	Desc	below counts 50 times.
	
	Attr	DCat
	Indicator	IDanger	INBoost
	CountDef	20

OnStart:
	Boost	IDanger	Add	0
	
OnJudge:
	If	Answer	=	J	A	M
		Counter	-1
		Boost	IDanger	Add	0.0
	ClearIf
	
	If	Answer	!=	M
		Boost	INBoost	Mul	2.4
	ClearIf
	
	If	Counter	<=	0
		Kill
	ClearIf
	